  "title": "人間評価とLLM-as-a-judge",
  "topic": "AI運用",
  "summary": "生成AIの出力を人間や別のLLMで評価するときの利点と限界を学びます。",
  "created_at": "2026-09-27",
  "base_duration_ms": 680,
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Zheng et al., Judging LLM-as-a-Judge with MT-Bench and Chatbot Arena",
